    "sections": {
        "description": "SKT Lace is a stylish WordPress theme. It is used for lacework, patchwork, embroidery, needlework, fabric ornamentation, and textile craftsmanship businesses. It suits boutiques, sewing studios, fashion designers, quilt makers, and handmade fabric stores. The theme features a responsive layout, WooCommerce compatibility, Elementor support, customizable sections, SEO friendly code, and one click demo import. Showcase intricate creations, decorative textiles, and artisan collections with an elegant website that attracts customers and highlights your creative expertise. Documentation: https://www.sktthemesdemo.net/documentation/skt-minimal-doc/"
    },
